\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1.  \cf0  Oh! watch out after this dark night
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 the morning light is risen,
\par now the sun is appearing
\par it is coming from the east
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All you nation rush to the scene
\par now the light of the world is born
\par \i   ://:Jesus Christ is his real name://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.   The king of all the kingdoms
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Has come from the heaven's above
\par to become a child on this earth
\par man just like us human beings
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And there in the stable was born
\par the prophesied child of David
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\i      ://: Here, the Saviour of the world://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   Yes my Saviour and my Lord
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  Jesus the son of God
\par  You came to this earth of sinners
\par  from the heavenly glory
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par What tongue is there to adore you
\par  befittingly eternal God
\par \i    ://:what will equal your glory? ://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.  Poor wretched sinner like me
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  who is (weak)  and afraid
\par  because you have called me to you
\par  You came into this world
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Take my heart and let it be thine
\par  And forgive me all my sins
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\i ://:entirely as your thanks. ://\i0 :
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   You my Lord are the Saviour
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 for all mankind everywhere
\par  O! have mercy upon all those
\par  who are on the path of sin
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let all the ends of the world come
\par  to you and worship only you
\par \pard\i     ://:Redeemer, Giver of  life ://:\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

